<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2154_8073.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtnachbarlich</unclear> willig diennst zuouor,
<lb n="2"/>Fürsichtige ersame unnd weise, besonders liebe
<lb n="3"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünd</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">3.t</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear></date>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Italianischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegß</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volckhs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abermalen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verthraüwlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bericht</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schreiben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernommen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solcher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">comunication</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> be-
<lb n="8"/>danckhen, khönnen beineben hingegen zuberichten
<lb n="9"/>nit underlaßen, daß unß uff heüt dato vertrew-
<lb n="10"/>liche auiso eingelangt, waßmaßen albereit zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Cre-
<lb n="11"/>mna</placeName> 7000. deß gedachten kriegßvolckhs ankhommen,
<lb n="12"/>die werdden <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-311" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Mailand</placeName> befeits ligen laßen, und auff
<lb n="13"/><placeName resp="#ner">Varese</placeName> zuoziehen, unnd allew ie 500. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">compa</unclear>-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nia</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nacher</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Teütschland</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marchiren</unclear>, auch alle ihre
<lb n="15"/>rüstunngen inn pallen oder küssten mit sich fuehren,
<lb n="16"/>deren die erste <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auffß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">längst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">14</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tagen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drej</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wochen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-87" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rorschach</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlangen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welches</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">continuierung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbar</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">licher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verthraüwlichkeit</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unuermelt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> laßen
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbleiben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derselben</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/>nachbarlichen diennsten wol beigethon, datum
<lb n="22"/><origDate when="1619" resp="#ner">11.ten octobris a° 1619</origDate>.
<lb n="23"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd
<lb n="24"/>rhat der statt Lindaw</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2154_8074.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2154_8075.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2154_8076.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="25"/>Den Fuersichtigen, Ersammen und Weißen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="26"/>unnd Rhat der Statt St: Gallen</orgName>, unßeren insonders lieben
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbouren</unclear>.
<lb n="28"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName>.
</p>
